# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your backend origin.

# The backend origin, SERVER ONLY (no NEXT_PUBLIC prefix, never shipped to the
# browser). The Next server is a reverse proxy: the next.config.ts rewrites
# forward same-origin /api/v1 and /socket.io to this origin, and the server
# components read from it for the first paint. The browser only ever sees our
# own origin, so the session cookie stays first party (no CORS, no SameSite=None).
BACKEND_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5000

# Optional. A distinct socket origin for the CSP connect-src, only if the socket
# is served from somewhere other than our own origin. Normally left unset.
# BACKEND_WS_ORIGIN=
